    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Revitalize the Nature</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put the <strong>Magic Generators</strong> in the right place according to their color to restore part of the nature and bring life again to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750440/extras/c08a92477ca5c90fde448044d652905f.poster.avif?t=1754340791\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750440/extras/c08a92477ca5c90fde448044d652905f.webm?t=1754340791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750440/extras/c08a92477ca5c90fde448044d652905f.mp4?t=1754340791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Travel through different Lands</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet different places as you progress in your journey, each with a unique aesthetics and characteriscs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750440/extras/64b5e407e0ed4eaa7dfe8529efc5b758.poster.avif?t=1754340791\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750440/extras/64b5e407e0ed4eaa7dfe8529efc5b758.webm?t=1754340791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1750440/extras/64b5e407e0ed4eaa7dfe8529efc5b758.mp4?t=1754340791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Eradicate the Corruption</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clean the world from the evil and corrupted magic that spread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_i